<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- BUU</book>
  <para style="h">PHM - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc1">PHM - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc2">PHM - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc3">PHM - BUU</para>
  <para style="mt1">PHM - BUU</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Mbe nyi zhu ri me Bulus riwa wa tren wen ri tra tren ritu me bla tre Kristo, ga vayi mbu Timoti, hi ri kpan mbu Filimon nga kpan ndu mbu, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />nga Afiya vayi mbu vruwa, nga vayi mbu riwa a ran ti ka nji ri klukpa mbu riwa nde wan a he Akibus nga wa hu Izhi wawa wa si kabrutu ri ko wen: <verse eid="PHM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />No A ti mbu Izhi nga Bachi Yeso Kristo no yi dindi ti nga sii sron.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyɨme Nga Yosron riwa Filimon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />A wu vayi won Filimon, me sondu ngɨri ri Izhi meri taka wen rimi bre Izhi won, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />ritu me wo bibi yosron wen ri Bachi Yeso nga bibi nyɨme wen riwa wu he ri wu ri wa hu Izhi. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Me bre Izhi no kabrutu mbu iwayi ka wa hu Izhi ri ngɨzhi to ri tilɨbu riwa ki he ri wu ri son mbu ri kabrutu mbu ri Kristo. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />A wu vayi won, inyɨme wen no wen kinklan sron nga ran no wen senkpa! Wu no wa hu Izhi senkpa wawu.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus a Bre Ritu Onisimas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Ritu ngayin me fe gbengbren bran, ka vayi wen rimi Kristo me fe gbengbren ri la wu kya riwa a he riwa wu ti. <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />Ama ritu nyɨme mbu, me bre wu nye, me ran ri vu no ti wu ran. A he ame Bulus riwa me kunchon nga riwa wa tren wen ri tra tren ritu Yeso Kristo. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Me bre ritu Onisimas riwa a he ka ivren won rimi Kristo riwa me he ri tra tren, <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Ri sen a ran he kya ri wu ran, ama zizan a he kya ri wu nga ri mo ngawen. <verse eid="PHM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Me bru ti wu ndu ri ye ri wu riwa wawu he ka isron won riri. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Me wa meri ka-u dzi ri ngawon ri nyi riwa me he ri tra tren, ritu la tre Kristo, nga ran dzon wen ti ndu ri nyu wen. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Ama me ran wa me ri ti kya riwa a ran he ri to wen ran, Me wa no dzon ritu wu wa wu ri dzon a ran ritu wa vuu no dzon ran. <verse eid="PHM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />A zhu ka Onisimas a kado ri vi hari ritu riwa ari bru ye ri wu ri wawu nye. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />Onisimas ran he gran ri wu ka kre ran. A han gran, a he vayi, a zizan ri mo. Zizan ari he kya ri wu, ari he ka gran nga ka vayi rimi Bachi. <verse eid="PHM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Ritu ngamba, ka wu ban wen ri me he kpan ndu wen, wu ka kpa Onisimas zhu bibi riwa wu kpa wen. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Ka a ti kya meme ri wu, ko wu hu kyari wu ka bla yo ri tu won. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Ame Bulus nye me nghan mbe nyi ri wo won. Me han kya riwa wu hu, Ama ra kpawulusu ri me hu kya ngawen ran. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Ritu ngamba vayi won, me bre wu ti ndindi ti nyi ri mo ritu Bachi; Sii wen sron rimi Kristo. <verse eid="PHM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Me nyɨme ri wu ri wu hu tre won, ritu wan nye me nghan mbe nyi ri no wu ri to ri wu ti han kya riwa me tre ri no ti. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Me bre wu, ka tra tsren dzi ri mo, ritu me yo sron ri Izhi ri wo bre mbi ran no wen me kɨma bru ye ri yi a ran ban vi bran ran.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichi ri Kre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Abafaras riwa a he ri me ri tra tren rinyi ritu Yeso Kristo a ri chi wu, <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />ri Markus, Aristakus, Dimas, nga Luka wawa wa he wa kpan ndu won nye wa chi wu ngawen. <verse eid="PHM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />No ndindi ti Bachi Yeso Kristo no he ri yi wawu mbi.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>